Package: tind-optins
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: zenity, pkexec, flatpak, curl, ca-certificates
Installed-Size: 96
Description: Tind Apps: opt-in application installer
 A small checklist tool for the apps Tind does not install by default (Nextcloud
 preconfigured for lagrr.servr.no, Spotify, Steam, Claude, Bitwarden). Apps are
 described by small files in /usr/share/tind/optins.d, installed from apt or
 Flathub, and each can also be installed from the command line.
